    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discussion Over Dinner is a simple, snappily paced experience which forces you to quickly formulate coherent responses to your new neighbor's almost interrogatory questions in real time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543000/extras/864800887ca245fde15785280fa9ce13.avif?t=1743805283\" width=616 height=325 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you keep the conversation flowing, study your host's body language for any sign of irritation while remembering to keep your own physical mannerisms in check.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depending on your social skills you may be able to leave the table good friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or you might become another secret he'll have to hide from a future dinner guest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543000/extras/85c28b91f085e92ff5f78dfccafb7e3c.avif?t=1743805283\" width=616 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discussion Over Dinner is designed specifically to be played on computer with a keyboard and requires every key to be working properly in order to play.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please only play the game if it's running at a smooth framerate to avoid any potential softlocks or sequence breaks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discussion Over Dinner is a simple, snappily paced experience which forces you to quickly formulate coherent responses to your new neighbor's almost interrogatory questions in real time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543000/extras/864800887ca245fde15785280fa9ce13.avif?t=1743805283\" width=616 height=325 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you keep the conversation flowing, study your host's body language for any sign of irritation while remembering to keep your own physical mannerisms in check.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depending on your social skills you may be able to leave the table good friends!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Or you might become another secret he'll have to hide from a future dinner guest.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3543000/extras/85c28b91f085e92ff5f78dfccafb7e3c.avif?t=1743805283\" width=616 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discussion Over Dinner is designed specifically to be played on computer with a keyboard and requires every key to be working properly in order to play.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please only play the game if it's running at a smooth framerate to avoid any potential softlocks or sequence breaks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
